<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:57:23 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>埋藏在 OpenAI 最新研究中：人工智能使用与员工人均收入之间没有相关性</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/buried-in-openais-latest-research-no-correlation-between-ai-use-and-revenue-per-employee/</link><description>人工智能实验室正在努力解决一个对其未来至关重要的问题：ChatGPT 企业客户能否获得明确的投资回报率？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287521321-e1786645857178.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 20:28:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/buried-in-openais-latest-research-no-correlation-between-ai-use-and-revenue-per-employee/</guid></item><item><title>大学正在买卖数据中心的财产，引发人们对人工智能人才流失的担忧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/george-washington-university-of-michigan-property-sale-ai-data-center-development/</link><description>乔治华盛顿大学最近将其弗吉尼亚校区出售给亚马逊，密歇根大学提议耗资 12 亿美元开发新的数据中心。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2215736974-e1786475943838.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/george-washington-university-of-michigan-property-sale-ai-data-center-development/</guid></item><item><title>当这位媒人带着价值 35,000 美元的客户去一家软椒盐卷饼餐厅约会时，这位媒人迅速走红，但他并没有缴纳“秃头税”或“短头税”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/matchmaker-viral-clients-bald-short-men/</link><description>由于对高个子男人的迷恋，一些矮个子或秃头的男人必须向这位病毒式媒人缴税，因为这需要为她做更多的工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2224237870-e1786652333789.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 20:19:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/matchmaker-viral-clients-bald-short-men/</guid></item><item><title>走进里克·里德 (Rick Rieder) 的世界，这位资产达 2.3 万亿美元的失眠者可能很快就会执掌美联储</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/01/27/rick-rieder-fed-chair-race-2-3-trillion-polymarket-kalshi-bond-trading/</link><description>Rick Rieder 负责监管贝莱德约 2.3 万亿美元的固定收益业务。他对风险的痴迷使他成为市场传奇人物，并且令人惊讶地成为美联储主席的竞争者。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/GettyImages-613164570-e1769530779396.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 27 Jan 2026 17:19:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/01/27/rick-rieder-fed-chair-race-2-3-trillion-polymarket-kalshi-bond-trading/</guid></item><item><title>ICE 斥资 2000 万美元购买的电击手套已经送给奥马哈公立学校的警察</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/ice-electric-shock-gloves-omaha-nebraska-public-schools/</link><description>2025 年 5 月，奥马哈警察局获得了超过 65,000 美元的奖励，购买了 40 双手套。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2279657007-e1786648135249.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 20:02:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/ice-electric-shock-gloves-omaha-nebraska-public-schools/</guid></item><item><title>旧金山一名“科技恶作剧者”在同一条街上订购了 50 辆 Waymos，暴露了机器人出租车的网络/安全气囊问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/a-san-francisco-tech-prankster-got-50-waymos-ordered-onto-the-same-street-exposing-robotaxis-cyber-airbag-problem/</link><description>加州要求自动驾驶汽车制造商证明他们可以安全地监控、更新和维护车队，同时遵守网络法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2250807489-e1786646430687.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:45:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/a-san-francisco-tech-prankster-got-50-waymos-ordered-onto-the-same-street-exposing-robotaxis-cyber-airbag-problem/</guid></item><item><title>“对中国媒体的多部分案例研究”发现人工智能模型无法通过幻觉消除中国的审查制度</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/chinese-censorship-ai-models-case-study/</link><description>新研究表明，中国官方媒体和独裁言论限制可以塑造美国领先人工智能模型产生的答案&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2285789352-e1786649692485.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:59:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/chinese-censorship-ai-models-case-study/</guid></item><item><title>马尔科姆·格拉德威尔宁愿有一个年薪10万美元的父亲，也不愿有一个年薪10亿美元的父亲：极端的财富“会严重削弱你的动力”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/author-malcolm-gladwell-extreme-wealth-crippling-to-motivation-ambition-shaped-by-hardship-career-advice/</link><description>畅销书作家马尔科姆·格拉德威尔认为，在经济困难的情况下成长实际上可以更好地帮助孩子为成功做好准备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2220629892-e1786634057321.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 15:56:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/author-malcolm-gladwell-extreme-wealth-crippling-to-motivation-ambition-shaped-by-hardship-career-advice/</guid></item><item><title>微软开始合并消费者和企业Copilot应用程序以推动超级应用程序</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/microsoft-begins-merge-consumer-and-enterprise-copilot-ai-apps/</link><description>这家软件巨头从本周开始向一小部分用户开始在两个平台上推出统一的体验。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2262967205-e1786638544148.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 16:48:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/13/microsoft-begins-merge-consumer-and-enterprise-copilot-ai-apps/</guid></item><item><title>Kalshi 的首席执行官正在竞相为人工智能最宝贵的资源建立一个期货市场，到 2030 年该资源的价值可能达到 100 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/kalshi-compute-futures-cme-intercontinental/</link><description>计算是新的石油，但建立其期货市场可能同样混乱。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287750415.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/kalshi-compute-futures-cme-intercontinental/</guid></item></channel></rss>